{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a686a6230dbc40c2197afe5bb6149008db4826e0636f986d21d5bd0b03eb8f28",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:402298ebb673a013be85e4f0c02d82ac5e1d20376792a93e45168e582c6b5a48",
      "text": "事务所辞掉了，也没工作。\n现在也只是坐在这里发牢骚而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c601caec7c826976b7704f02fc11eef79ffb9e48ffa478b70526e2af5a6ee410",
      "text": "但想让别人展露笑容的心情是没有变的。\n想必今后也一直都不会变。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2511229021652ab409bbe4786fbc09d36026c4e10533bcb272a385656f96147d",
      "text": "所以我无论发生什么，\n都不会从自己的梦想中逃避的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78248f6491e25ee4dafb560e4cdd95be90b576c195c6a1fecc9ab2fdcc39c5c3",
      "text": "哎呀……光有气势可就太逊了。\n嘿嘿，明天开始也得继续加油才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625193e0662d1b0d3052dcc231f3f6972754f06ab6b186d3aa1e156991c0b5f8",
      "text": "（辉先生，是真的发自内心地\n想要让大家展露笑容啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca9dcc29b917d96d7980db8707d72ca5858af63d7b9e4887a2a6bfaebbcc6e0",
      "text": "辉先生。关于那个梦想，能否也让我\n助您一臂之力呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e81347583b78bc7dc1eb5dd3bf4bcbcc66742cf56673131f955a82d51cffa00",
      "text": "嗯？帮忙，是指……\n这是，名片？315 Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe631da2db9dadffb32224f248df7a6ad70f1e6eecc7755dcca2724107b35845",
      "text": "是的。恕我冒昧还未自我介绍，我其实\n在一家偶像事务所担任制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebf7c9423a0ea1e38a1f5290a12427eb7852d9ed9a8d130f56b58b8debbd03a7",
      "text": "下次事务所会举办一场试镜，\n您愿意去参加试试吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_01_1_1_002_01:1_1_002_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7734af98331a9dc7f4239a2e2d6004b5c094ba926e395b790094ea1d69142fc2",
      "text": "当偶像……我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
